# Burning Sun Cavalry: "while you control a Dinosaur" is checked as the creature attacks, as part of the trigger event, not as the ability resolves
# (it is no intervening "if", CR 603.4). Bot1 attacks with the Cavalry while it controls a Nest Robber (a 2/1 Dinosaur); Bot2 responds with a
# Lightning Bolt on the Nest Robber, leaving Bot1 no Dinosaur, yet the Cavalry still becomes a 3/3 and deals 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mountain
Burning Sun Cavalry
Nest Robber
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Burning Sun Cavalry.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Nest Robber.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Burning Sun Cavalry > Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Nest Robber)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Burning Sun Cavalry.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Burning Sun Cavalry.Toughness = 3

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Nest Robber = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Life = 17
